---
layout: null
permalink: /sitemap.xml
sitemap: false
---
{% comment %}
  Sitemap do Google — enumera TODAS as URLs indexáveis do site.
  Criado manualmente porque o jekyll-paginate-v2 remove as páginas paginadas
  (blog index, índices e categorias com paginação) de `site.pages`, e o
  jekyll-sitemap não as enxerga. Assim o Google recebe a lista completa.

  Conteúdo:
    • Home
    • Índices paginados: /blog/ e /servicos/ (+ /page/N/ quando existir)
    • Todos os posts do blog
    • Todos os artigos de serviço
    • Categorias do blog e de serviços
    • Depoimentos (coleção testimonials)
  A página 404 (noindex) é omitida de propósito.
{% endcomment %}<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  {%- comment -%} Home {%- endcomment -%}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site.url }}/</loc>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>1.0</priority>
  </url>

  {%- comment -%} Índices paginados {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%} As páginas /page/N/ só existem no build local (jekyll-paginate-v2).
     No GitHub Pages elas retornam 404, então NÃO entram no sitemap. {%- endcomment -%}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site.url }}/blog/</loc>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.9</priority>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site.url }}/servicos/</loc>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.9</priority>
  </url>

  {%- comment -%} Posts do blog {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for post in site.posts -%}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site.url }}{{ post.url }}</loc>
    {%- if post.last_modified_at -%}
    <lastmod>{{ post.last_modified_at | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
    {%- elsif post.date -%}
    <lastmod>{{ post.date | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
    {%- endif -%}
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.7</priority>
  </url>
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- comment -%} Artigos de serviço {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for servico in site.servicos -%}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site.url }}{{ servico.url }}</loc>
    {%- if servico.last_modified_at -%}
    <lastmod>{{ servico.last_modified_at | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
    {%- elsif servico.date -%}
    <lastmod>{{ servico.date | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
    {%- endif -%}
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.7</priority>
  </url>
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- comment -%} Categorias do blog {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign blog_cats = site.posts | map: 'categories' | join: ',' | split: ',' | uniq | sort -%}
  {%- for cat in blog_cats -%}
    {%- if cat != '' -%}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site.url }}/blog/categoria/{{ cat | slugify: "latin" }}/</loc>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.6</priority>
  </url>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- comment -%} Categorias de serviço {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for servico in site.data.servicos -%}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site.url }}/servicos/categoria/{{ servico.slug }}/</loc>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.6</priority>
  </url>
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- comment -%} Depoimentos {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for dep in site.testimonials -%}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site.url }}{{ dep.url }}</loc>
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.4</priority>
  </url>
  {%- endfor -%}
</urlset>